{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0From the inspiration of games like Banjo Kazooie comes Journey North, a third person adventure puzzle game. Take control of Liam as he takes the adventure of a lifetime. Discover what is hiding in the woods behind his house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Explore your way through a giant mushroom forest will helping the local Gnomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help them restore the Runes that the Beast of the North disrupted in their villages. Collect items and complete puzzles to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Taking inspiration from old school games Journey North is filled with the humor and chard to keep you playing again and again. This game takes small worlds with a Nordic twist to make it have a fast pace feel but not a rushed experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a giant mushroom forest right out of a fantasy novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete puzzles and challenges to help you on your journey north to confront the Beast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An old school feeling game to bring back the nostalgia of the past</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Journey North is a gaming experience sure to bring you back to the good old days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416160?t=1741872837","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416160?t=1741872837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416160/27401f24e6e181c6a2462142cc1fe96d7e252181/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741872837"